BISOS-AI-Workflow, the workflow-guiding part of AI-Activity: the /bx-* commands you invoke, grouped by when a session uses them, and the general skills Claude loads. The commands are the workflow, not an activity's: one set in mother/_claude/commands/ of the aiTemplates-workFlow tree, which every templates base includes (assembled with an ecosystem's own tree). Leaf colour shows where each lives in the templates tree.
